 props←DefinePen State;pen;fcol
⍝ Create GUI properties to be used with line-drawing figures

 :Select ⊃pen←State._pen
 :Case ¯1 ⍝ A pen-handle
     props←('Pen'GetHandle 2⊃pen).Props ⍝ Retrieve the predefined property list
 :Case 0 ⍝ Transparent/invisible pen
     props,←⊂'LStyle' 5
 :Else ⍝ Draw a circle's edge
     props←⍬
     props,←⊂'LStyle'(pen⊃⍛⊃0 6 1 2 3 4) ⍝ 1→0, 2→6, 3→1, 4→2, 5→3, 6→4
     fcol←⍬ ##.Classes._supp.color2 2⊃pen ⍝ Convert APL+Win color into a 3⍴ Dyalog color ⍝? Do we need to pre-check for any errors here?
     props,←⊂'FCol'fcol
     props,←⊂'LWidth'(3⊃pen)
 :EndSelect
